  "title": "Cheesy Onion Dip-Stuffed Potatoes",
  "description": "Enjoy the delicious taste of chips and dip with these stuffed potatoes full of a cheesy, sour cream- and onion-flavored twice-baked potato filling.",
  "authors": [
